SOMA is a Sci-Fi Horror game from creators of Amnesia The Dark Descent
Pros:
The plot is very interesting, the game takes place in a underwater research facility;
The environment and colors are very nice;
Conversations are well made;
The computers and doors mechanics is nice.
Cons:
Graphics is good but not much updated compared to Amnesia;
Theres some fps drop and FXAA is the only option for antialiasing;
IA is very bad, much easier to hide from enemy.
will update soon as I play.

Anno Online is a free to play browser based strategy simulation game that lets you build and manage big Medieval cities.  Sort of like Sim City as a medieval island city game with some naval combat and trading added.  Based off of the Anno game franchise.  It worked, looked ok, has an extensive tutorial.  Looked like you can play some without paying real money.
It is free to play, give it a try if you like Sim City type games.
for more info:

This game is a piece of art.
Beautiful melancholic the background,(inspired by paintings of Zdzislaw Beksinski, Hieronymus Bosch)
Disturbing music;
Awesome atmosphere;
Your choices are relevant;
Replay value
a little short 3-5h
9/10

I've been playing this game on browser since the last year. I'm still on lvl 15, and I can say: it's a good game. IMO, is the best browser-based game ever (since the others that I liked so much are dead now, like The Sims Social...).
Also, I've never payed a single "ruby" (cash) in this game, and my island still growing. The secret is: play some minutes today, you money and resources will end and tomorrow everything will be filled again. I'm doing this since March 2015, and today I've almost 3000 rubys. There are after a contruction that "create" ruby, and with my calculations we can get she full upgraded without puting cash. After, maybe a single put, but i'm not reached this part.
Good:
- Graphics;
- Music;
- Gameplay;
- It's FREE!
The visual are pretty good, and I must say that this game "relax" me. The visual of the houses and the island itself as also very good. And the game is free, and the space is almost invisible to your hardrive.
Bad:
- A think nothing;
Maybe the difficult. Is too easy for this kind of game, and we are talking about the "Anno" franchise, but this depends about your preferences.
============================================================
Maybe I reviewd this "postive" because I play on the browser for months, and is "useless" download trough Steam. Go play on your browser :v
